{"t": "API dla deweloperów", "b": "<h1 id=\"api-dla-deweloperow\">API dla deweloperów<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#api-dla-deweloperow\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h1>\n<p>OmniGuard udostępnia typowaną usługę w <code>ServicesManager</code> Bukkita oraz zdarzenia Bukkita. Kompletny, kompilujący się przykładowy\nplugin znajduje się w <a href=\"https://github.com/plisquante/OmniGuard/tree/main/examples/api-example\"><code>examples/api-example</code></a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"konfiguracja\">Konfiguracja<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#konfiguracja\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Dodaj jar OmniGuard do classpatha kompilacji (scope <code>provided</code> / <code>compileOnly</code>) i zadeklaruj zależność:</p>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c1\"># plugin.yml</span>\n<span class=\"nt\">depend</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p p-Indicator\">[</span><span class=\"nv\">OmniGuard</span><span class=\"p p-Indicator\">]</span><span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\"># or softdepend</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">OmniGuardService</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bukkit</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getServicesManager</span><span class=\"p\">().</span><span class=\"na\">load</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">OmniGuardService</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">class</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">null</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// OmniGuard not installed</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<div class=\"callout warn\">\n<p>Używaj tylko klas z <code>dev.omniguard.api</code> i <code>dev.omniguard.api.event</code>. Cała reszta jest wewnętrzna i może się zmienić.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"omniguardservice\">OmniGuardService<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#omniguardservice\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Metoda</th>\n<th>Opis</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>version()</code></td>\n<td>Wersja pluginu</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isAttackMode()</code> / <code>setAttackMode(\"auto\"\\|\"on\"\\|\"off\")</code></td>\n<td>Tryb ataku</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isMonitorMode()</code></td>\n<td>Tryb tylko wykrywania</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isLockdown()</code> / <code>setLockdown(boolean)</code></td>\n<td>Blokada serwera</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>stats()</code></td>\n<td><code>StatsSnapshot(packets, blocked, kicks, refusedConnections, dupes, packetsPerSecond, blockedPerSecond, trackedItems)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>checks()</code></td>\n<td>Mapa ID checka → włączony</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getViolationLevel(uuid, checkId)</code> / <code>getViolations(uuid)</code></td>\n<td>Aktualne poziomy naruszeń</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>exempt(uuid, checkId, Duration)</code></td>\n<td>Tymczasowe wyłączenie z jednego checka lub <code>\"*\"</code> dla wszystkich</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>clearExemptions(uuid)</code> / <code>isExempt(uuid, checkId)</code></td>\n<td>Zarządzanie wyłączeniami</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>reportViolation(player, source, detail, amount)</code></td>\n<td>Przekaż własne wykrycia do alertów, Discorda, logów OmniGuard i kar checka <code>external</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getLinkedAccounts(name)</code></td>\n<td>Konta, które współdzieliły IP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getItemIdentity(item)</code></td>\n<td>Tożsamość przedmiotu w ledgerze</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>trackItem(item)</code></td>\n<td>Nadaj przedmiotowi tożsamość od razu (np. nagrody ze skrzynek); wywołuj w wątku, do którego należy przedmiot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getCustody(uuid)</code></td>\n<td>Łańcuch posiadania (<code>CustodyStep(timeMillis, holder)</code>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isCompromised(uuid)</code></td>\n<td>Czy potwierdzono, że tożsamość została zduplikowana</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<p>Wszystkie metody poza <code>trackItem</code> są bezpieczne wątkowo. Nieznane ID checków rzucają <code>IllegalArgumentException</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"przykady\">Przykłady<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#przykady\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"wyacz-gracza-z-checka-na-czas-twojej-wyrzutni\">Wyłącz gracza z checka na czas twojej wyrzutni<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#wyacz-gracza-z-checka-na-czas-twojej-wyrzutni\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">exempt</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">player</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getUniqueId</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"invalid-movement\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Duration</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">ofSeconds</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n<span class=\"n\">player</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">setVelocity</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">new</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Vector</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h3 id=\"zgos-wasne-wykrycie\">Zgłoś własne wykrycie<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#zgos-wasne-wykrycie\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">reportViolation</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">player</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"MyAntiCheat\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"reach 6.2 blocks\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1.0</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h3 id=\"sledz-nagrody-ze-skrzynek\">Śledź nagrody ze skrzynek<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#sledz-nagrody-ze-skrzynek\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">ItemStack</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">reward</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">new</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ItemStack</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Material</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">NETHERITE_SWORD</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"n\">UUID</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">trackItem</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">reward</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"n\">player</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getInventory</span><span class=\"p\">().</span><span class=\"na\">addItem</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">reward</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"zdarzenia\">Zdarzenia<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#zdarzenia\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Zdarzenie</th>\n<th>Anulowalne</th>\n<th>Kiedy</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OmniGuardViolationEvent</code></td>\n<td>tak (tłumi alert i karę)</td>\n<td>Każdy nieudany check</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OmniGuardPunishEvent</code></td>\n<td>tak (karę obsługujesz sam)</td>\n<td>Tuż przed kickiem lub komendami kary</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OmniGuardDupeEvent</code></td>\n<td>tak (bez konfiskaty, bez alertu)</td>\n<td>Potwierdzono duplikat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OmniGuardAttackModeEvent</code></td>\n<td>nie</td>\n<td>Tryb ataku się zaczyna lub kończy</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<div class=\"callout warn\">\n<p>Zdarzenia naruszeń i kar mogą być <strong>asynchroniczne</strong>, bo checki pakietów działają w wątkach Netty. Użyj schedulera, zanim dotkniesz świata. Anulowanie nigdy nie przepuszcza złośliwego pakietu.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"nd\">@EventHandler</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">onPunish</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">OmniGuardPunishEvent</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getCheckId</span><span class=\"p\">().</span><span class=\"na\">equals</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"packet-rate\"</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">setCancelled</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kc\">true</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"w\">                         </span><span class=\"c1\">// no kick from OmniGuard…</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">jail</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">send</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getPlayerId</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getDetail</span><span class=\"p\">());</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// …your own handling</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"statyczny-pomocnik\">Statyczny pomocnik<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#statyczny-pomocnik\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<p><code>OmniGuardAPI</code> (statyczny) nadal istnieje do szybkich odczytów: <code>isAttackMode()</code>, <code>getViolationLevel(...)</code>,\n<code>getBlockedCount(...)</code>, <code>getItemIdentity(...)</code> oraz <code>service()</code>, który zwraca pełny <code>OmniGuardService</code>.</p>", "c": "<a href=\"#konfiguracja\">Konfiguracja</a><a href=\"#omniguardservice\">OmniGuardService</a><a href=\"#przykady\">Przykłady</a><a href=\"#zdarzenia\">Zdarzenia</a><a href=\"#statyczny-pomocnik\">Statyczny pomocnik</a>"}